iddle-east/middle-east-crisis-iran-proposes-30-day-plan-to-end-war-says-it-has-received-us-reply/articleshow/130743370.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-05-04T07:45:46+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130743457,imgsize-656646.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Tensions intensify at Strait: Cargo ship sailing near Hormuz attacked by Iran]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130743260.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A bulk carrier was attacked by small craft near Iran's coast in the Strait of Hormuz, with all crew reported safe and no environmental impact. This incident occurs amidst heightened tensions as the US enforces a counter-blockade on Iranian ports and plans to guide ships through the strait, drawing a strong warning from Tehran.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/tensions-intensify-at-strait-cargo-ship-sailing-near-hormuz-attacked-by-iran/articleshow/130743260.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/tensions-intensify-at-strait-cargo-ship-sailing-near-hormuz-attacked-by-iran/articleshow/130743260.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-05-04T07:39:43+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130743372,imgsize-121948.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[More Strait talks: Trump rolls out 'Project Freedom' to guide ships through Hormuz]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130742958.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[US President Donald Trump launched 'Project Freedom' to aid commercial ships stranded in the Strait of Hormuz, citing humanitarian concerns and low supplies.  He stated the US will guide vessels safely out, emphasizing these ships belong to nations uninvolved in regional disputes. Trump also revealed positive discussions with Iran, though he rejected their latest proposal for conflict resolution.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/more-strait-talks-trump-rolls-out-project-freedom-to-guide-ships-through-hormuz/articleshow/130742958.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/more-strait-talks-trump-rolls-out-project-freedom-to-guide-ships-through-hormuz/articleshow/130742958.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-05-04T07:14:04+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130743008,imgsize-119530.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Marco Rubio DJs at wedding, seen wearing headphones and leaning over decks in viral video]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130739485.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/secretary-of-everything-marco-rubio-djs-at-wedding-seen-wearing-headphones-and-leaning-over-decks-in-viral-video/articleshow/130739485.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/secretary-of-everything-marco-rubio-djs-at-wedding-seen-wearing-headphones-and-leaning-over-decks-in-viral-video/articleshow/130739485.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-05-04T02:22:54+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130739614,imgsize-68860.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Brown kids' comment was out of love: Michigan democrat El-Sayed says JD Vance is 'deeply evil' though]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes