t consulted and has conveyed its position to both nations, urging them to cease activities in the disputed region.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/south-asia/nepal-stirs-row-with-india-objects-to-kailash-mansarovar-yatra-via-lipulekh/articleshow/130737361.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/south-asia/nepal-stirs-row-with-india-objects-to-kailash-mansarovar-yatra-via-lipulekh/articleshow/130737361.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-05-03T23:02:12+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130737402,imgsize-38648.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Brixton Drive-By Shooting Probe: Four men hurt in moving-car attack; police hunt suspects]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130737184.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Four people were injured in a shooting from a moving car in Brixton shortly after midnight on Saturday. A 25-year-old man is in critical condition, while three others sustained non-life-threatening injuries. Police are conducting an intensive investigation, reviewing CCTV and gathering witness statements to identify the suspects responsible for this act of indiscriminate violence.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/brixton-drive-by-shooting-leaves-four-injured-one-in-critical-condition/articleshow/130737184.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/brixton-drive-by-shooting-leaves-four-injured-one-in-critical-condition/articleshow/130737184.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-05-03T22:51:49+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130737180,imgsize-62880.cms"/></item><item><titl